    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "msgctxt": "502488",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Traitor.\nI'm not like YOU. I'll protect #[him][her]#,\nno matter the sacrifice.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "msgctxt": "502864",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Yes. You forgot.\nAnd foisted the memories all on me.\nNow only you are back to normal.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "msgctxt": "503316",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…those are the feelings you discarded.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "msgctxt": "503436",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "And I―― will prove it!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "msgctxt": "504120",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Good morning, Senpai!\nI thought up a new way to make\ndelicious tea today!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "msgctxt": "504196",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I hope you like it…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "msgctxt": "504308",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hrm… Where can I find data on\nJapanese and Western sweets…\nI hope I'm authorized to use that data…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "msgctxt": "504416",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……I remember.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "msgctxt": "504572",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\n…that's right. I see now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "msgctxt": "504900",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…Senpai. You were the first Master\nto pay any attention to me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "msgctxt": "505132",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But that day, when I had collapsed due to a bug,\nyou came and helped me as if I was human.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "msgctxt": "505484",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That's why I meddled with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nI began using its power for my own gain.\nI used it to be with you.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "msgctxt": "506060",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C080080080Remember, remember――#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "msgctxt": "506112",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Woah, that actually happened?\nHehe, that's funny.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "msgctxt": "506656",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Senpai――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "msgctxt": "506680",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hey, Senpai…!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "msgctxt": "506700",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\n\n\n#C080080080――――Everything reverts to zero.#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "msgctxt": "506756",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C080080080I hear a very distant voice.#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "msgctxt": "509480",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But no passerby pays it any mind.\nPeople can't hear stones, after all.",
      "pt": ""
    },
