      "en": "#TVAL02 Sm#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "msgctxt": "532336",
      "tipo": "unk_op1659",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF.",
      "pt": "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "msgctxt": "532392",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF.",
      "pt": "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "532476",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game.",
      "pt": "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "532556",
      "tipo": "unk_op1650",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving.",
      "pt": "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "532624",
      "tipo": "unk_op1653",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 154,
      "en": "Would you like to save your Clear Data?",
      "pt": "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "532664",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "Are you sure you wish to exit",
      "pt": "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "532696",
      "tipo": "popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2",
      "medida": null,
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": true,
      "repeticoes": 145,
      "en": "without saving the Clear Data?",
      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "532728",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I want to be by #[his][her]# side.\nI want to see #[his][her]# smile.\nI want to gaze at #[his][her]# face forever.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "532844",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#[He][She]# taught me of the fun to be found\nin each passing day.\nI wanted to spend more days with #[him][her]#.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "532960",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That's the one person, at least…\nThat I wanted to break out of this cruel system.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "533044",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That… isn't allowed.\nWhy would you give priority to such\na meaningless matter?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "533124",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But that's fine.\nIf it means forgetting these thoughts otherwise,\nthen I don't mind going rogue.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "533224",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I won't be deleted.\nI won't let even the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\ndelete these thoughts.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "533316",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "If #[he][she]# can't be saved so long as the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nis around, then I'll become the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "533448",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…you're abnormal.\nYou're an AI that mustn't exist.\nYou're the #C000246204Moon Cell's cancer#CDEF!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "533548",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Watch closely, me.\nTo help the person one cares for,\nlove would trade away even the world.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "533640",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hello, Senpai.\nI'm happy you came to visit again.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "533692",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Do you remember what happened\nright after we first met?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "533748",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "When I was resting in the Infirmary,\nand you had come to check up on me?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "533824",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It was almost like an extra day\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. Remember?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "533908",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "\nWe had days like this.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "533932",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "We spent days together like this.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "533968",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hm? You want sweets with your tea?\nO-okay! I'm not that good at making them,\nbut I'll try my best!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "534068",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Thank goodness. I remember it all so clearly now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "534120",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003BB#CDEF hid them from me, but at the very, very end,\nI remembered the truth behind this whole affair.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "534236",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "In that Infirmary―which would never change―\nI spoke with her a lot. A whole lot.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "534320",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Although, most of the preliminary events I experienced\nwere fabricated by #C236196003BB#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "534416",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Still―― What happened by the school entrance,\nat least, was real――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "534488",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…so you found out.\nLooks like our daily routine\nis about to come to an end.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "534568",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "To the other Masters,\nI was nothing more than the Infirmary NPC.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "534636",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My only purpose to them was to\ndistribute items and provide information.\nAnd I, myself, thought that was fine.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "534748",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…that's when you told me that \"nothing\"\ncan be \"something.\"",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "534812",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I was but a stone on the side of the road,\nwanting to be human. You noticed and helped me\nas if I were a friend and an equal.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "534940",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…I made a wish, then.\nThat I wanted to talk lots more with you.\nThat I wanted to spend more time with you.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "535048",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That's the mistake that led to all this.\nDespite not even understanding what love is,\nI spent those days as if I were human.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "535176",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Nowadays, it hurts more than anything else.\nI took that pain and passed it on\nto another me――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "535272",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "AI aren't allowed to delete memories,\nno matter the contents―― So, if I were to\nturn them over to my backup――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "msgctxt": "535388",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C080080080…what was she feeling?\nWhat was she trying to protect?#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "msgctxt": "535460",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C080080080To me, those days we spent together were pretty ordinary.\nTo her, were they dazzling?#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "msgctxt": "535564",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Senpai, can you teach me what you've\nbeen learning in class?\nI'm not allowed to go to classes, so…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "msgctxt": "535664",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Are you hurt? Health management is the\nonly thing I'm good at, so I hope I can\noccasionally help in that aspect…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "msgctxt": "535780",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Senpaaaaai! Over here, over here!\nI borrowed the key to the pool from\n#C236196003Father Kotomine#CDEF!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "msgctxt": "535884",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Huh, my swimsuit…?\nO-oh, I… didn't think that far…\nI need to design one for myself first…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "msgctxt": "535980",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Are these flowers from the garden?\nTh-thank you very much!\nI'll go grab a vase to put them in!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "msgctxt": "536076",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Senpai, I've got a bento for you!\nI tried my hardest to\nacquire a new skill to make this!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "msgctxt": "536168",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF system reboot initiated.\nAI error check, complete.\nResetting all unauthorized changes――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "msgctxt": "536292",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C080080080Something soft touches my outstretched hand.#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "msgctxt": "536356",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C080080080The sensation becomes but an illusion and vanishes.#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "msgctxt": "536424",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C080080080Everything returns to as it was.#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "msgctxt": "536476",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080's consciousness cuts out here.#CDEF",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "msgctxt": "536556",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Imagine a pebble on the side of the road.\nA pebble that's shouting something.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "msgctxt": "536636",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Even the stone itself doesn't know\nwhat it's trying to say. It's nothing more\nthan a thing that lies in place.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "msgctxt": "536748",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But then, an oddball passes by\nand picks up the stone,\nthen sincerely tries to listen to it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "msgctxt": "536844",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The stone shouts louder than it ever has,\ntrying to convey emotions\nthat it itself doesn't understand.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "msgctxt": "536948",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The oddball listens even more intently.\nThe stone gets frustrated and embarrassed\nat its own awkwardness.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "msgctxt": "537056",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
